<title>USA: Radius Inc appoints Mark Housley pres.</title>
<headline>Radius Inc appoints Mark Housley pres.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Radius Inc said Tuesday that Mark Housley has been appointed to the position of president and chief operating officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>A 20-year industry veteran and previously a general manager of Radius' graphics and Splash division, said Housley will be responsible for overseeing Radius' day-to-day business activities, including sales, marketing and operations, the company said.</p>
<p>The announcement from the company did not say who formerly held the positions.</p>
</text>
